OL,3,GNEWSAIndoor soft play centres
OL,4,Astruggling to stay open
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a soft play area in north
OL,7,FShropshire said it is in danger of
OL,8,Fclosure as the hot summer has meant
OL,9,Fcentres like hers have struggled to get
OL,10,Fpeople through the doors.
OL,12,FJessica Harvey has run Funzone in
OL,13,FWhitchurch for over a year, and said
OL,14,Fthe industry is seasonal, with there
OL,15,Fbeing occasions when she was the only
OL,16,Fone at the centre all day.
OL,18,F"Over the summer, there has definitely
OL,19,Fbeen [times] where we probably had 10
OL,20,Fto 15 people in all week, which just
OL,21,Fisn't sustainable", she said.
