OL,3,GNEWSAIndoor soft play centres
OL,4,Astruggling to stay open
OL,5,
OL,6,FFunzone, which has existed as a soft
OL,7,Fplay centre in Whitchurch for 17 years,
OL,8,Fwas sold two years ago. But the company
OL,9,Fthat bought it went into liquidation,
OL,10,Fmeaning Harvey was able to buy the firm
OL,11,Fin October 2025.
